[N 46-48 Azshara]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\Darnassus and Rut'theran hand-ins, then Azshara from Talrendis Point (new flight path and bind): Loh'atu, Berdun and Truesong at 45, then at 47 Saria Fairmoon's chain through the Ruins of Eldarath, Ekkal, Kim'jael, Tymor's runes and Pilot Xiggs on his island. Ends at Talrendis Point's hippogryph master.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel check|r  -  this chapter wants level 47: nine Azshara quests need it (Making Contact, Saria Fairmoon's five, Kim'jael Indeed!, The Legashi Threat, Ill Tidings). Darnassus, Rut'theran and the level-45 Talrendis quests come first, but on quest XP alone you are about 6,700 XP short of 47 when the level-45 quests are done: do the conditional quests here that your level opens (Winter Frontier Fishery if the squid bites; Dragonscale Leatherworking only at Leatherworking 225 with its items), or kill Mosshoof Runners and the Spitelash of the open quests, until you turn 47; do not accept the level-47 quests before. Past Talrendis the mobs run 48-55: Warlord Krellian at the Ruins of Eldarath is 55, the giants on the south and east coasts are 52-55 elites
[OC]|cffffffffDarnassus and Azshara|r  -  you start at Nijel's Point in Desolace (end of chapter 54), hearth = Gadgetzan; it moves to Talrendis Point in this chapter. About 84,800 quest XP from 23 required hand-ins and 5g 3s of quest money; the lines marked "only if" are not counted
[OC]|cffffcc00Sources:|r givers, hand-ins, mobs and the runes come from the DB; the Rut'theran portal, the Astranaar - Talrendis road, the Wasp Nests, the staff's container, the three tablets, the Mark of the Queen and the Ursolan furbolg quests are not in it (unverified, said on each line)
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r Doling Justice (2972), Rise of the Silithid (4267) and In Search of Knowledge (2939) from chapter 50; Rise of the Silithid (162) and Handle With Care (3022, the crate) from chapter 53; Arcane Runes (3449) from chapter 52 with the Drawing Kit and the Standard Issue Flare Gun in the bags
[OC]|cffffcc00Training:|r no shaman trainer on this route; the level 46 and 48 rows wait for Ironforge in chapter 57

